atisfied and POL-NS-03 displaces it. On the evidence: the traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-09105-01 is MISSING (weight 0.0, issue code MISSING_ARTIFACT), so POL-NS-06(i) cannot be used to accumulate separate intervals; the trace, trip record, chat log and fare breakdown show no clock skew, no gap, no message-count mismatch and no fee mismatch, so no artifact is impaired under POL-NS-08(a)–(d) and the deciding facts are carried by weight-1.0 artifacts. No two admissible artifacts conflict, confidence is above the 0.70 floor, and no POL-NS-09 trigger fires, so the case is decided on the merits rather than escalated. Your profile is used only as credibility weighting: under POL-GEN-01 the lifetime prior_no_show_flags counter is context only and is not the field POL-NS-07 reads, and on no_show_terminations_30d of 1 against 120 completed trips no anti-farming pattern arises. No clause produces a referral."
