t is not used against you; no anti-farming finding is made (no_show_terminations_30d 1 against 120 completed trips, far below the POL-NS-07 threshold).\n\nThe two POL-NS-04 claims: whether the driver's 13:06:00 message counts as a reply to the rider's locating messages under limb (b) is arguable (the rider's operative 13:06:35 message went unanswered and no in-app call was made), but it does not change anything — POL-NS-04 would grant exactly the same full refund with no compensation that POL-NS-03 gives, so the case is decided under POL-NS-03.\n\nNo escalation and no referrals: all deciding artifacts carry weight 1.0 with no POL-NS-08 impairment (the 13:05:20 arrived event lands on a fix, no trace gap, 4 chat messages match chat_message_count 4, and the 4.00 SGD cancellation fee equals the greater of the LARGE_VENUE zone fee and the RYDE_X tier fee), no two admissible artifacts conflict, and no POL-NS-09 trigger fires. The MISSING traffic advisory EV-ADVIS-09105-01 (weight 0.0) is relied on only for its absence, which does not affect the outcome.\n\nAmount: FULL_REFUND of 4.00 SGD, the whole contested amount, with no split because no POL-NS-08 impairment is engaged."
